<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">2 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="toc3">2BaTe</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung kufɛ́ afa fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aTesaloni</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 BaTesaloni</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung kufɛ́ afaa fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aTesaloni</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk aBulus, nɛ aSilas nɛ aTimoti, sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na BaTesaloni, iba fɛ́ ba yet bafɛ́ Ada Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Won itek ni kukyang fi ku nes na Ada Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni ku sot gung ni yin.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inesek ifeng nɛ awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ábaruneng, a yet agbing-gbing ni feng yit Adakunom nek iyin kaakyi izen, i se gyat anɔng, nek i tsin rasak yin makiyi ni inɔɔk atsak yin, ni ishim fi ibang rasak nate yin. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Nek anɔng wu fi in di tsot kugwɔm ni iyin nate banet ikuus Adakunom nek ite nyɛk ni inesek atsak fi itonoso yin ni izen izot ni imara fɛ́ ba ki nesek yin.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ngma anɔng e tonoso fok ishɔt Adakunom se gyat, nek anɔng wu fɛ́ ba bi ki fa fok ikyɛm yin kunɔ ni igwɔm Adakunom, idɔng fi i tsin bɔrɔng yin nek ide. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Adakunom ras ishɔt atsak: a bi tarang bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ki tang yin izot ni izot, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />na nɔk ifɔɔn sak ni yin fi i tsin bɔrɔng yin, ni iyit bà. Anɔng e bi te ni izen fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso bi ne azanɛn na ábere árong nɛ batomaza wu fɛ́ ba kyem makiyi. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />A bi tang izot sak na bayɔng fɛ́ da ba rēn Adakunom awo, fɛ́ ba raba ifok ifɛ̀ itek ifɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Ba bi sɔ mgbang fi in se vit nkum, ba bi ka ba ro ashon aTisa nɛ karɔ kukyem ízɔk wu. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Atuk fɛ́ a bi bɛ́ me, banet ajɛrɛ bi ku nesek iratek, a bi te ngma banet fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak yɔɔt atuk e yɔng, ngma ni iyin nek iyin nɔɔk yin atsak ni kucɛɛt fi in ki tak yin.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nek anɔng e wu fɛ́ a sak kaakyi izen in ki ras yin awon, nɔng Adakunom yit da ki fa yin fok i kyem yin ni kasa fi iwu ki nye yin ne, ni kukyem wu, na a ki sak yin ni i kyem iras yin kaakyi ikyɛng itek fi i shim ira yin nek inɔɔk atsak yin ni wu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />In ras yit awon nɔng iyerek aTisa yit aYeso da sɛs itere nate yin, ni wu sak ni i sɛs yin itere bá, i da te anɔng nek itek Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Anet iraye Ntsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Azaton kubɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni itusung fɛ́ ba bi ki nye yit ne, ábaruneng in ra yit awon ni yin, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />i bi bɛ́ yin ayɛ gak kɛ ayɛt nnyim fok kunom aTisa mi got awo, bakak mi ki nye yin ncɛɛt abes ni itom nɛ afumung naton anɔng yɛ fok a ne ni yit. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />I bi won yin akak ki wɔrɔk yin na kaakyi irèn awo, nek kunom e yɔng bi tsang nye awo ma idorok nhwyɛ tun bɛ́, ma anet ibeseng ntsi ne ninyɛn, iwu fɛ́ ba mi sak ba da wey ni wu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Iwu bi tɛnɛng na ceshek ice wu naton ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba yes ina nfɛ́ Adakunom kɛ nyɔng fɛ́ ba da ku ya mo ntong ayi, a bi tsɛ a sonong nitu iya Adakunom ntong fok iwu wu a yet Adakunom.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />I mi yiring yin awɛ, ni izen fi in kin se ni iyin, in ma ni in ki taas yin nkyɔrɔk nang awɛ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Yɔkɔnɔng, iyin rēn yin ikyɛng fi i rēn ku tɛnɛsɛ, kɔn a bi wuruk dang izen wu ni i nye. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Nek yɔkɔnɔng ba se ni kutomong inɛt ibeseng ntsi; awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a ku tɛnɛsɛ, da ya kashon ni tɛnɛsɛ wu sak izen fɛ́ ba bi ku serek ni irèn. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ama anɔng, anet ibeseng ntsi me bi ne tun ice wu, iwu fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso fɛt ni nsong fi in bi nes nanu wu, a bi wey ni wu ni mgbey kubɛ́ wu. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ba bi rēn kubɛ́ anet iraye ntsi me ni rèn ntomong abes, nkyɔrɔk ayɔɔt mbɔɔs fɛ́ aShetan bi ras, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />ni ntomong anyas fi in bi wɔrɔsɔ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin wɛɛs. Ba wɛɛs nek ba raba ishim atsak fɛ́ a da ka ba sheshek. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom da kaba tom ni iwɔrɔsɔ agap, nɔng ba di ki nɔɔk atsak ni mbɔɔs e, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />nɔng ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba ishan atsak, na ba dun tere anyas, ba bi ka ba ya ni ishɔt.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyeseng yin gak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Ábaruneng, i se gbing-gbing ni in feng yit Adakunom kaakyi izen mok iyin, nek ishim fɛ́ a ki nye yin ne, fɛ́ a ki kasa yin ni imɛsɛng, a ki sheshek yin ayɛt kutomong ikanang fɛ́ Kabik nyes, ni rèn ishan atsak. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />A ki yes yin ni ye ni irèn ishara ifɛ̀ itek fi in ki nye yin ne, nɔng i da bin sɛ yin kanu kafiin ni ízɔk aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, nyeseng yin gak, bereng yin itees fi in kin ki nabak yin ne, iyɔng fi in kin ki nye yit ne kanu ni ifi ijɛk.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Won aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ice wu, nɛ Ada Adakunom, fɛ́ a ki tonong yit ishim, ayɛt itek wu, a tɛ ki nɔɔk yit agap iyɛ fɛ́ a bi nkum e awo, ni ite iyɛ itek, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />a ki nɔk yin agap iyɛ, a ki gbinding yin na kaakyi kutomong ni kucɛɛt kutek.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Itsɛt awon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ni gang e ábaruneng, ki ras yit awon, mok ifɛ̀ aTisa bin sɛ iya kashon ziri ziri, ni i sɛ iratek kyɔn ti fi i kin di te ni iyin. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ki ra yit awon nɔng ba ki tun yit ni bɔk áduk e nɛ ámaan ánet, nek da ngma banet fɛ́ ba mi nɔɔk atsak awo. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Awɛt aTisa yet afi itak ni ishining, a di ki nɔɔk yin agap na ki bereng yin kɔn i bi kpa yin ni bɔk amaan e. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Iyit bɛ̀ yit ite iyɛ na aTisa fok i tsin nye yin ikyɛng fi in ki tak yin, i da ya yin kashon na anɔng. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Won aTisa na bang ki tonong yin ayɛt ayɛ, ishim Adakunom ni igbingding Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itabak naton kusot arut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ábaruneng, in ki tak yin ifɛ̀ ni iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, iba nye yin ikyi ikak na afɛ́ arut ayɛt yin awo, iwu yɔng fɛ́ da a nye kusot kpaf ni itees fi i sɛ yin ni yit awo. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Nek iyin ice yin i rēn yin kusot fi ku se gyat ni di kuus yin ikyɛng fi imɛɛs yin ni yit. In yet yit bafɛ́ arut awo, ni izen fi in se yit gung ni yin, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />da in man ya yit ikyɛng akak dang in ku tarang yit awo. Ka ni kuro, iyit bɔrɔng yit itiri kunom nɛ katuk ni tomong, kɔn in bi sot yit acet na akak yin. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Da fok inye yit anɔng, nek in kyem yit ni yin i ki sɛ yit mo awo, tit nek in shim in sot yit ikyɛng imɛɛs sak ni yin. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Nek ni izen fi in resek yit gung ni yin, in kin ki tak yin fok, &lt;&lt;Ngma anet fɛ́ da a shim ira kutomong awo, ba bi ku nɔk kuyak awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />In mi fok yit fok bakak ayɛt yin bɛ̀ karut. Ba shim iras kutomong awo; wɔn inɔs aze na aza kyɛk. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Banet tɛ bayɔng, won in ki tak yin, in cɛɛt ni yin ni iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, won na ba men nhwyɛ bá, na ba tsɛt ikyɛng iya. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Wat iyin ábaruneng, i bi rɔrɔng yin ni iras ikyɛng fi i se gyat awo.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ke akak rawu dang fok itabak fin in jɛk yit ni fumung kang, di te ayisi makiyi ni wu. I bi moon yin ice ni wu awo, nɔng a da fok nsum. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ngma na anɔng, i bi ku sok yin tɛ afi ifa yin awo, tit ku kɔrɔk yin kuto tɛ arunyining yin.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite show itek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Won aTisa ice wu fɛ́ a nesek kukyang, na a ki nɔk yin iko kaakyi izen, na kaakyi irèn. ATisa na se gung ni yin.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Imi aBulus wu in tsin jɛk ashow yong ni kubɔk hom, anɔng wu a tonong fi in di tes, ijɛk hom yong i se anɔng.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Won itek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni i sot gung ni yin ngma.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>